<title>SINGAPORE: Taiwan buys November unleaded reformate around $23.80.</title>
<headline>Taiwan buys November unleaded reformate around $23.80.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's state-owned Chinese Petroleum Corp (CPC) has bought by tender one cargo of 95-octane reformate around $23.80 per barrel for November 1-20 delivery on a cost-and-freight basis, a CPC source said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The 250,000-barrel cargo will be delivered to Keelung or Taichung.</p>
<p>In its last tender, CPC bought 500,000 barrels of unleaded reformate for October 16-30 delivery at nearly $24.00 per barrel c-and-f basis.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65-8703084)</p>
</text>
